  "description": "A private NuGet feed for ASP.NET Core - the NuGet V3 protocol (service index, package content, registrations, search, autocomplete) plus push, unlist, relist and delete, so `dotnet nuget push`, `dotnet restore`, Visual Studio and Rider all work against it unchanged. Packages live in the same folder layout NuGet itself uses, the version rules are NuGet's own (NuGet.Versioning), and the whole path is trim- and AOT-clean.",
